{{/* switch: the compact on/off control shared by table toggle cells, settings
     rows, the form row and the conditional's gate. It is a checkbox, never a
     toggle: nothing in this app flips live — every state here is staged for the
     commit — and a toggle's knob would promise that it had. CSS-only (peer): the
     checkbox drives the box's fill and its check. Callers pass any value with
     On (bool) and Name (form name, optional).

     The control is a bare span, so a caller can wrap it in whatever label the row
     around it calls for without nesting one label inside another. Where it has a
     form name it carries that as its id too, so a label elsewhere in the row —
     the conditional's, at the form's own measure — points at it. */}}
{{/* An 18px box in the input's own dress — white, the inset shadow, the strong
     hairline — with no hover state. Checked, it fills in the body ink, the same
     ink a selected segment takes and never the action colour, and a white check
     sits in it. */}}
{{define "switch.control"}}<span class="relative inline-flex size-4.5 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center">
  <input type="checkbox" data-verso-switch{{if .Name}} id="{{.Name}}" name="{{.Name}}"{{end}} class="peer sr-only" value="1"{{if .On}} checked{{end}}>
  <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-xs border border-rule-strong bg-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(27,25,23,.06)] transition-colors peer-checked:border-body peer-checked:bg-body peer-focus-visible:outline-2 peer-focus-visible:outline-offset-2 peer-focus-visible:outline-denim"></span>
  <span class="relative text-white opacity-0 peer-checked:opacity-100">{{icon "check" "size-3.5 [stroke-width:3]"}}</span>
</span>{{end}}
{{/* switch.row: the labelled form row — the control with its label beside it. */}}
{{define "switch.row"}}<label class="flex min-h-10 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink">
  {{template "switch.control" .}}
  <span>{{.Label}}</span>
</label>{{end}}
<label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center">{{template "switch.control" .}}</label>
